From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openworld-kernel <noreply@openworld>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] virtio_balloon: more aggressive inflation/deflation for
 overcommitted hosts

Stock virtio-balloon converges slowly on large inflate/deflate requests,
which hurts dense Firecracker hosts that balloon many microVMs at once:

- VIRTIO_BALLOON_ARRAY_PFNS_MAX=256 moves only 1 MiB (4K pages) per
  inflate/deflate virtqueue round-trip, so a 512 MiB inflate needs 512
  tell_host() round-trips.
- fill_balloon() sleeps 200ms after every allocation failure, so
  inflation under memory pressure stalls for seconds.
- OOM deflation releases only 256 pages (1 MiB) per OOM event.

Make ballooning more aggressive for microVM overcommit:

- 256 -> 1024 pfns per batch (4 MiB per round-trip on 4K pages, 4x fewer
  round-trips; the pfn array grows from 1 KiB to 4 KiB).
- 200ms -> 20ms retry sleep on allocation failure. The outer
  update_balloon_size work requeues until diff==0, so this makes large
  inflates converge ~10x faster under pressure without spinning.
- OOM deflate 256 -> 1024 pages (up to 4 MiB freed per OOM event).

No behaviour change when the host does not balloon: towards_target()==0
never enters fill/leak paths. All virtio feature bits (stats,
deflate-on-OOM, free-page-hint, reporting, poison) are untouched.

Tunable: edit the two defines / msleep below to taste.

Signed-off-by: openworld-kernel <noreply@openworld>
---
 drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c | 9 ++++++---
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c b/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
index 123456789012..123456789013 100644
--- a/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
+++ b/drivers/virtio/virtio_balloon.c
@@ -26,9 +26,9 @@
  * page units.
  */
 #define VIRTIO_BALLOON_PAGES_PER_PAGE (unsigned int)(PAGE_SIZE >> VIRTIO_BALLOON_PFN_SHIFT)
-#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_ARRAY_PFNS_MAX 256
+#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_ARRAY_PFNS_MAX 1024
 /* Maximum number of (4k) pages to deflate on OOM notifications. */
-#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_OOM_NR_PAGES 256
+#define VIRTIO_BALLOON_OOM_NR_PAGES 1024
 #define VIRTIO_BALLOON_OOM_NOTIFY_PRIORITY 80

 #define VIRTIO_BALLOON_FREE_PAGE_ALLOC_FLAG (__GFP_NORETRY | __GFP_NOWARN | \
@@ -258,8 +258,11 @@
 			dev_info_ratelimited(&vb->vdev->dev,
 					     "Out of puff! Can't get %u pages\n",
 					     VIRTIO_BALLOON_PAGES_PER_PAGE);
-			/* Sleep for at least 1/5 of a second before retry. */
-			msleep(200);
+			/*
+			 * Aggressive: retry quickly so large inflates converge
+			 * faster under pressure (outer work requeues on diff).
+			 */
+			msleep(20);
 			break;
 		}

--
